		2 Size_of_the_anterior_glabellar_lobe /  Similar_size_to_the_rest_of_the_glabellar_lobes 'Greatly enlarged, clearly distinct from the rest of glabellar lobes',
		3 Shape_of_the_anterior_glabellar_lobe /  'Sub-oval with anterior margin transverse or almost transverse in medial area, anterolateral corners rounded' 'Semi-circular with anterior margin greatly bowed anteriorly' 'Sub-rectangular, with anterior margin transversal and anterolateral corners relatively pointed' 'Sub-trapezoidal, with medial part of the anterior margin transversal, anterolateral corners slightly rounded and lateral side of the anterior margin sloping posterolaterally',
		4 Degree_of_inflation_of_the_glabella /  From_flat_to_slightly_inflated Moderately_inflated Dramatically_inflated,
		5 Glabella_dorsally_overlap_anterior_border_of_the_cranidium_ /  Absent Present,
		6 Glabellar_sculpture /  Smooth_or_tiny_granulated Granulated Bearing_coarse_tubercles,
		7 Distribution_of_the_ornamentation /  Sparse_arranged Densely_arranged,
		8 Glabellar_tubercles_simetrically_organised_in_hopaspid /  Equally_distributed_overall_the_surface Tubercles_organised_simetrically_by_pairs,
		9 Three_pits_in_the_anterior_glabellar_lobe /  Absent Present,
		10 Slope_of_the_anterior_border_from_the_horizontal /  Transverse Downturned_anteriorly_,
		11 'Definition of the anterior border furrow laterally, separating the anterior border of the cranidium from the fixigena' /  'Present, well defined' Highly_effaced,
		12 Expression_of_glabellar_furrows_S2_and_S3 /  Present Absent_or_highly_effaced,
		13 Orientation_of_glabellar_furrows_S2_and_S3_ /  Backwards Transversal,
		14 'Width (tr.) S2 and S3' /  'Wide (tr.) at least one quarter of the glabellar width' 'Narrow (tr.), reduced to the glabellar margin',
		15 'S1 transglabellar, connected across the glabella' /  Absent Present,
		16 Depth_of_the_transglabellar_S1 /  'Shallow, expressed as a faint depression' 'Deeply incised, well defined',
		17 Orientation_of_S1_at_the_distal_part_adjacent_to_the_axial_furrow /  Posteriorly_directed Transversal,
		18 Orientation_of_S1_proximally /  S1_bending_posteriorly_running_oblique_downwards_and_inwards 'S1 bending posteriorly, running parallel to the anteroposterior axis',
		19 Width_of_S2_and_S3_respect_S1 /  'S3 and S2 same width (tr.) than S1' 'S3 and S2 narrower (tr.) S1' 'S3 and S2 wider (tr.) than S1',
		20 Shape_of_the_posterior_margin_of_the_glabella_ /  Bowed_anteriorly_at_medial_part Transverse,
		21 Shape_of_the_occipital_ring_ /  Rectangular_ 'Sub-trapezoidal, with anterior margin anteriorly convex' Bowed_anteriorly_,
		22 Position_of_the_eye /  'Anterior (Ratio of distance from the posterior tip of the palpebral lobe to the posterior cephalic margin / cranidial sagittal length ≥ 0.45)' 'Medial (Ratio < 0.45 and > 0.25)' 'Posterior (Ratio ≤ 0.25)',
		23 'Length (exsag.) of the palpebral lobe' /  'Short (Length exsag. of the palpebral lobe/length exsag. of the fixigena ≤ 0.35)' 'Relatively long (Length exsag. of the palpebral lobe/length exsag. of the fixigena > 0.35)',
		24 'C-Shaped palpebral lobe' /  Absent 'C shaped, intewards and outwards margins broadly bowed outwardly',
		25 Definition_of_the_eye_ridge_in_holaspid /  Well_defined_by_an_eye_ridge_furrow Absent_or_not_well_defined_by_an_eye_ridge_furrow_,
		26 'Presence of sutural ridge along the anterior section of the facial suture, being continuous with the anterior border of the cranidium' /  Absent Present,
		27 Eye_ridge_cross_the_fixigena /  Absent Present,
		28 'Genal spine elongated, with a stout base at the genal angle' /  Absent Present,
		29 Prefixigenal_spines /  Absent Present,
		30 Number_of_prefixigenal_spines /  1 2,
		31 Fixigena_tuberculated /  Fixigena_without_tubercles Fixigena_with_tubercles,
		32 'Pair of tubercles alienated in the fixigen, posterior to the palpebral lobe ' /  Absent Present,
		33 Direction_of_the_posterior_branch_of_the_facial_suture_from_the_palpebral_lobe_to_the_lateral_border_furrow /  Sloping_posteriorly Transversal Sloping_anteriorly,
		34 Rostral_plate_bearing_a_pair_of_spines /  Absent Present,
		35 Anterior_lobe_of_the_middle_body_of_the_hypostome_overlap_the_hypostome_anterior_border /  Absent Present,
		36 Shape_of_the_anterior_border_of_the_hypostome /  'Slightly bowed anteriorly, abaxially anterior wings from almost transversal to slightly turned posteriorly  ' 'Greatly bowed anteriorly, abaxially anterior wings turned posteriorly ' 'Transversal adaxially, anterior wings turning forward abaxially',
		37 Definition_of_the_maculae_ /  Well_defined Not_well_defined,
		38 Shape_of_the_posterior_border_of_the_hypostome /  Posteriorly_bowed_broadly Transverse Slightly_anteriorly_bowed,
		39 Pair_of_posteriorly_directed_spines_in_the_posterior_border_of_the_hypostome /  Absent Present,
		40 Length_of_the_hypostome_middle_body /  'Elongated (Sagittal length / Maximum width > 1.2)' 'Non elongated (Sagittal length / Maximum width > 1.2)',
		41 Anteroposterior_exsagittal_constriction_of_the_thoracic_pleura /  Absent Present,
		42 Width_proximal_part_of_the_thoracic_pleura /  'Long (≥0.75)' 'Medium (≥0.4 <0.75)' 'Short (width of proximal part of the thoracic pleura/width of axial ring <0.4)',
		43 Orientation_of_the_pleural_furrow /  'Running slightly oblique from the anterior corner of the pleura, straight all along the furrow' Transversal Oblique_adaxially_and_transversal_abaxially_ Oblique_slightly_curved_abaxially,
		44 Type_of_pleural_furrow /  Continuous_furrow Line_of_pits,
		45 'Pleural furrow turns forwards abaxially (exsag.) at the fulcrum' /  Absent 'Shallow, as a small depression ' Well_defined,
