		48 First_pygidial_segment_furrowed /  Present Absent,
		49 Dorsal_inflation_of_the_pygidial_axial_rings /  'Axial rings inflated dorsally, being the first the most inflated, and decreasing in inflation gradually posteriorly' 'First axial ring inflated, second and third flat and extremely reduced, creating flat depression between the first axial ring and the pygidial rim',
		50 Second_most_posterior_axial_ring_differentiated_by_axial_furrow_from_the_pleural_field /  Differentiated Not_differentiated,
		51 First_pygidial_segment_is_a_thoracic_segment_not_detached_ /  Absent Present,
		52 Size_of_the_anterior_pygidial_flange /  'From small to medium size, never exceeding the maximum pygidial width (tr.) ' 'Strongly developed, laterally prominent',
